WEBVTT

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:08.133 line:75% position:67% align:start size:30%
Start your personal setup.
After connecting your workspace, choose Start setup.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:14.500 line:75% position:3% align:start size:30%
Confirm your identity.
Check the name and work email imported from your workspace.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:22.567 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Choose the closest work scope.
The scope changes the companion’s context — not your official role.

00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:28.933 line:75% position:3% align:start size:30%
Review what it listens for.
Keep or remove the responsibilities, outputs, and evidence signals.

00:00:28.933 --> 00:00:35.300 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Check your working schedule.
Review your working days, timezone, and notification preferences.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:42.867 line:75% position:3% align:start size:30%
Read the privacy policy.
Understand screenshot analysis, retention, and sensitive exclusions before accepting.

00:00:42.867 --> 00:00:54.517 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Accept only when you are ready.
This demonstration consents locally. No employee account is changed.
